<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse shut on religious holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse shut on religious holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange was closed on Thursday due to a local religious holiday, one dealer said.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Sunday after the Friday and Saturday weekend.</p>
<p>The exchange's 100-share price index closed 3.15 points, or 0.23 percent, higher on Tuesday amid 146 losers and 97 gainers on a turnover of 24 million, up from Monday's 22 million.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
